Package: ascendo
Source: ascendo
Version: 0.0.7
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: bash (>= 5.0),
 python3 (>= 3.11),
 python3-pip,
 python3-venv,
 git,
 curl,
 jq,
 ca-certificates,
 util-linux,
 sudo
Recommends: timeshift | etckeeper, snapd, flatpak, fwupd, libsecret-tools
Suggests: nodejs (>= 18), npm
Maintainer: Mateusz Kasprowicz <gaipro.mk@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/KasprowiczM/ascendo
Description: Cross-platform unified updates orchestrator (CLI + dashboard)
 Ascendo is a hybrid CLI + local FastAPI dashboard + Tauri 2.x desktop
 shell that drives a 5-phase per-category update pipeline across
 Linux (apt/snap/flatpak/brew/npm/pip/drivers), macOS (brew/mas/
 softwareupdate/web/launchctl) and Windows (winget/msstore/MSI/
 Windows Update). Each run emits structured JSON sidecars (schema v1)
 so the state of every update is auditable. Includes single-prompt
 sudo, live progress streaming over SSE, snapshot integration
 (timeshift / etckeeper), and a localizable web dashboard.
